          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this Warlord Advances, do not make an Advance roll. Instead, until the end of the phase, add D3+3&quot; to the Move characteristic of this Warlord.
Each time you make a charge roll for this Warlord, you can add 6 to the result.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
