            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Warlord is on the battlefield, each time you or your opponent spends any Command points to use a Stratagem, you can roll one D6 for each Command point spent: on a 6, you gain 1 Command point.
