            <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">If manifested, select one friendly YNNARI unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack&apos;s wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
