    <selectionEntry name="The Starmist Raiment" id="04cd-a585-4089-a3b1" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" page="117" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="518c-58e3-7347-be23" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Starmist Raiment" id="7a59-5a5a-260f-ac4b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">HARLEQUIN&apos;s model only.
Each time an attack is made against the bearer, that attack&apos;s hit roll and wound roll cannot be re-rolled.
Once per battle, in your Command phase, you can declare that the bearer will mimic Aelos. If you do so, until the start of your next Command phase, the bearer has a 3+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="The Laughing God&apos;s Eye" id="7813-bd0e-4df8-dbfc" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" page="117" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="c820-e959-3b64-0ae8" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Laughing God&apos;s Eye" id="4c3c-ba84-f1b1-458a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">HARLEQUINS model only. The bearer has the following ability:
&quot;The Laughing God&apos;s Eye (Aura): While a friendly HARLEQUINS unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+ that wound is not lost.&quot;</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
