          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">DARK model only.
In your opponent&apos;s Psychic phase, the bearer can attempt to deny one psychic power as if it were a PSYKER. If the bearer is a PSYKER, the bearer can attempt to deny one additional psychic power in each of your opponent&apos;s Psychic phases.
The bearer has the following ability: &quot;Hideous Form (Aura): While an enemy unit is within 3&quot; of this model, that unit loses the Objective Secured ability.&quot;</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
