                <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">D6+2</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this wepaon, if a hit is scored, draw a straight line between the closest point of the bearer&apos;s base (or hull) and that of the closest model in the target unit. Make one wound roll against the target unit, and ech other unit this line passes over.</characteristic>
