            <profile name="Serpent Shield" id="2f2f-d793-538e-b2be" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a unit contains any models equipped with a serpent shield:
Models in that unit have a 5+ invulnerable save against ranged attacks
Each time a ranged attack is made against that unit, an unmodified wound roll of 1-2 for that attack fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the model making the attack may have.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Crewed Platform (Storm)" id="561f-1d41-e4ce-eec5" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When the last Storm Guardian model in this unit is destroyed, any remaining Serpent&apos;s Scale Platform models in this unit are also destroyed. Serpent&apos;s Scale Platform models are not counted when determining a unit&apos;s Starting Strength, or whether that unit is below Half-strength. The destruction of Serpent&apos;s Scale Platform models is ignored for the purposes of Morale tests.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
