                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against the bearer&apos;s unit, ifthe attacking model is more than 18&quot; away, then the bearer&apos;s unit is treated as having the benefits of Dense Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
