                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, when the bearer&apos;s unit is selected as a target of a charge, you can select for the bearer to activate the wireweave net. If you do so, roll one D6. On a 2+:
The charging unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
Until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from charge rolls made for any unit that declares a charge against the bearer&apos;s unit.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
