                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Howling Banshee Exarch model only. Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, you can select one enemy unit within Engagment Range of the bearer and roll one D6; on a 2+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds, and an additional 1 mortal wound for each charge move the bearer has made during the battle.</characteristic>
