                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst this unit contains a Howling Banshee Exarch model, models in this unit have a 4+ invulnerable save against melee attacks.</characteristic>
