        <profile name="Transport (Wave Serpent)" id="231a-c5c9-1b96-2126" hidden="false" page="172" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity of 12 PHOENIX LORD, ANHRATHE INFANTRY or ASURYANI &lt;CRAFTWORLD&gt; INFANTRY models. Each WRAITH CONSTRUCT model takes the space of two INFANTRY models. It cannot transport JUMP PACK models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Wave Serpent Shield" id="5d7b-d6d8-1374-5334" hidden="false" page="175" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this model is equipped with a Wave Serpent Shield:
This model has a 5+ invulnerable save against ranged attacks.
Each time a ranged attack is made against this model, an unmodified woundroll of 1-3 for that attack fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the model making the attack may have.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2. Wave Serpent (4-6 wounds remaining)" id="c768-cd2e-ebbb-69c3" hidden="false" page="175" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Unit">
