            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, instead of making a Battle Focus move with this unit (pg142), you can remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
