                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit&apos;s Shining Spear Exarch model makes a melee attack, an unmodified wound roll of 5+ inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
