                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this unit&apos;s Dark Reaper Exarch model is equipped with a Reaper Launcher or Shuriken Cannon, each time that model is selected to shoot it makes 1 additional attack with that weapon.
If this unit&apos;s Dark Reaper Exarch model is equipped with an Aeldari Missile Launcher or Tempest Launcher, each time that model makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
