        <profile name="Transport (Falcon)" id="982f-af42-3e43-c50c" hidden="false" page="172" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity of 6 PHOENIX LORD, ANHRATHE INFANTRY or ASURYANI &lt;CRAFTWORLD&gt; INFANTRY models. Each WRAITH CONSTRUCT model takes the space of two INFANTRY models. It cannot transport JUMP PACK models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Cloudstrike" id="61b5-8193-6c0b-0d7c" hidden="false" page="172" publicationId="1f62-db93-63f4-4dc7" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this TRANSPORT model starts the battle set up preparing a Sudden Assault (see Sudden Assault, Page 143), it can be set up on the battlefield in the Reinforcement step of your first, second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules. Any units embarked within this TRANSPORT model can immediately disembark after it has been set up on the battlefield in this way, but they must set up more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
