          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Twilight Gloom has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, pick a friendly WRAITH HOST unit within 18&quot; of the psyker. Until the start of your next turn, that unit receives the benefit to their saving throws for being in cover, even while they are not wholly on or within a terrain feature.</characteristic>
