          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Psychic phase, this model can reknit wraithbone instead of attempting to manifest any psychic powers. If it does so, select a single &lt;CRAFTWORLD&gt; VEHICLE or &lt;CRAFTWORLD&gt; WRAITH CONSTRUCT model within 3&quot;. That model regains D3 lost wounds. A model can only be healed by this ability once per turn.</characteristic>
