                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack with a Damage characteristic of 1 is allocated to a VEHICLE model with this attribute, add 1 to any armour saving throws made against the attack.</characteristic>
