                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">WRAITH CONSTRUCT units (excluding AIRCRAFT units) with this attributeare eligible to perform Heroic Interventions as if they were a CHARACTER unit.</characteristic>
