              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of models with this Obsession.
Each time you make an unmodified saving throw of 6 for a model with this Obsession against a melee attack, after the attacking model&apos;s unit has finished making its attacks, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
