              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">LIGHT SHADOWSEER model only.
Add 3&quot; to the range of the bearer&apos;s aura abilities (to a maximum of 9&quot;).
Each time the bearer sucessfully manifests a psychic power from the PHantasmacy discipline, add 3&quot; to the range of the psychic power&apos;s effects.</characteristic>
