              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of this model, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of models in that unit (to a minimum of 1).</characteristic>
