                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;SAEDATH&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a charge roll is made for that unit, add 1 to the result.</characteristic>
