              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">IYANDEN model only. In your Command phase, you can select one friendly IYANDEN SPIRIT HOST unit within 9&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase;
