                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly ALTANSAR CORE unit within 6&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, you can re-roll Advance rolls and charge rolls made for that unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
