              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">YNNARI model only. Each time an attack is allocated to the bearer:
Subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack (to a minimum of 1)
