              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your opponent&apos;s Psychic phase, the bearer can attempt to deny one psychic power as if it were a PSYKER. If that psychic power is successfully denied, the PSYKER attempting to manifest that power suffers Perils of the Warp.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
