                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">The bearer can only shoot with this weapon once per battle. If it hits, the target suffers D3 mortal wounds. If the target unit has 11 or more models, it suffers D3+3 mortal wounds instead. Until the end of the turn, friendly units with the Power from Pain ability treat the current battle round as being one higher than it actually is when determining what effects they gain.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
