              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly KABAL OF THE BLACK HEART CORE unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a wound roll of 1. If the bearer is a REALSPACE RAIDER unit, this ability also affects BLADES FOR HIRE units.</characteristic>
